"[INFO] [1714730141.758813709] [rviz2]: OpenGl version: 3.1 (GLSL 1.4)\n"
"[ERROR] [1714730141.797879232] [rviz2]: rviz::RenderSystem: error creating "
"render window: RenderingAPIException: Invalid parentWindowHandle (wrong "
"server or screen) in GLXWindow::create at ./.obj-aarch64-linux-gnu/"
