"While following the :doc:`Creating a workspace <../../ROS-Framework/client-"
"libraries/Working-with-Client-Libraries/Creating-A-Workspace/Creating-A-"
"Workspace>` tutorial, you might encounter the following error stating that "
"``rosdep`` fails to install Qt5."
