#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Installation-Troubleshooting.rst:346
msgid "Running RViz with WSL2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Installation-Troubleshooting.rst:348
msgid ""
"If you are using `WSL2 <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/wsl/"
"install>`__ to run ROS 2 on Windows, you may run into an issue running RViz "
"that looks like:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Installation-Troubleshooting.rst:350
