"$ rviz2\n"
"[INFO] [1695823660.091830699] [rviz2]: Stereo is NOT SUPPORTED\n"
"[INFO] [1695823660.091943524] [rviz2]: OpenGl version: 4.1 (GLSL 4.1)\n"
"D3D12: Removing Device.\n"
